<li><code>getProjectEndpoint(projectId: string, endpointId: string)</code>: Retrieves details for a specific endpoint.</li>
<li><code>updateProjectEndpoint(projectId: string, endpointId: string, data: EndpointUpdateRequest)</code>: Updates settings for a specific endpoint.</li>
<li><code>deleteProjectEndpoint(projectId: string, endpointId: string)</code>: Deletes an endpoint from a project.</li>
<li><code>startProjectEndpoint(projectId: string, endpointId: string)</code>: Starts an endpoint.</li>
